# authorized_keys.example — template for the SSH pubkeys boot.sh installs
# to /root/.ssh/authorized_keys on the camera each boot.
#
# Copy this file to authorized_keys (same directory) and replace the line
# below with your own key. The real authorized_keys is gitignored — it
# stays on your SD card and in your deploy tree.
#
# ssh-rsa AAAAB3NzaC1yc2EAAAADAQABAAABAQ...  you@your-machine
